ries to the left and to the right of ${a}_{43}$ equal to zero.*" :question/worked-solution "Let's make entries to the left and to the right of ${a}_{43}=-1$ equal to zero using elementary column operations.\n\nSince adding a multiple of one row (or column) to another row (column) in a matrix does not change the value of its determinant, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,|\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 & 6 & -3 \\\\ 3 & -3 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 5 & -2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -1 & -3\\end{aligned}| &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{C}_{1}:={C}_{1}+2{C}_{3} \\\\ {C}_{2}:={C}_{2}+(-4){C}_{3} \\\\ {C}_{4}:={C}_{4}+(-3){C}_{3}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}14 & -20 & 6 & -21 \\\\ 17 & -31 & 7 & -23 \\\\ 3 & 2 & -1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the result along the $4$th row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,|\\begin{aligned}14 & -20 & 6 & -21 \\\\ 17 & -31 & 7 & -23 \\\\ 3 & 2 & -1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-1)\\cdot (-1)^{4+3}|\\begin{aligned}14 & -20 & -21 \\\\ 17 & -31 & -23 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}14 & -20 & -21 \\\\ 17 & -31 & -23 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 6\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-91196/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "01ff3b37-83e6-506a-a6e8-07858a2bcb66"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-91196"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186120472 :question/answer-fields 17592186119306] {:db/id "q-91092/selection/ma-v1/67d9f562809b421cef6d31441de2abb967dff42e6d970c9f5ecc88116c6f53f7/c47a48aba312cfe78a9072d4c071f633872dd437853a80cc58470f71a8a9638b" :answer/id #uuid "a9460acc-759f-59ab-8ef2-b9ede7534741" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2|\\begin{aligned}-3 & -6 & 9 \\\\ 2 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -7\\end{aligned}|" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-91092/selection/ma-v1/67d9f562809b421cef6d31441de2abb967dff42e6d970c9f5ecc88